# Files or directories whose basename starts with 000 are excluded from public tracking.
000*

# Public format checker outputs
public_format_report*.md
public_format_report*.json
public_format_release_report*.md
public_format_release_report*.json
concept_contract_report*.md
concept_contract_report*.json

